        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump, air-water, 15kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump, air-water, 15kW
Inventory for the production of an air-water heat pump, 15kW with a life time of 20 years.;
Synonyms: Wärmepumpe mit Wärmetauscher Luft/ Wasser 15kW; 
UUID: 571f4171-b256-31f5-b54b-fe3b5cb0a5d5
Infrastructure of the air-water heat pump including all material inputs (pipes, air heat exchanger, coolant) and also the energy use for the construction of the heat pump components.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_571f4171-b256-31f5-b54b-fe3b5cb0a5d5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
